Package: vabaxos-store
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, packagekit, appstream, flatpak
Description: Program store of VabaxOS, made for the screen reader
 Search programs by name or by what they do: the results arrive while
 you write and the voice says how many. Enter gives the description and
 Install, or Open and Remove. Programs of Debian are installed through
 PackageKit, as in GNOME Software; with "Also Flathub" the programs of
 Flathub too, for the user only (ADR-0008). The pieces VabaxOS needs to
 speak cannot be removed.
